y humoral immunodeficiency (PI); BIVIGAM\u00ae (immune globulin intravenous, human) for the treatment of PI; and NABI-HB\u00ae (hepatitis B immune globulin, human) to provide enhanced immunity against the hepatitis B virus.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1368514/000114036126031423/ef20079311_ex99-1.htm","filed":"2026-08-05","source":"8-K"},"da_v":2}